msgid "Internal Path (FA Robots)"
msgstr "内部路径（FA 机器人）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:197
#: 3dd670f1e78243cbb51a2690b8e22464
msgid "Internal Access Required"
msgstr "需要内部访问权限"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:200
#: fc49936d054e40989f73f01baaaad00e
msgid ""
"FA **deploy** (W1, W2, W2R, S2, S2R, dual-arm CCS) still requires access "
"to `fa-deploy-ws`. W1/W2/S2 URDF and Gen1/Gen2 USD remotes are public; "
"**W2R and S2R are not open**. See [FiveAges robot "
"descriptions](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md). "
"Contact your team lead for workspace access and hardware allocation."
msgstr ""
"FA **部署**（W1、W2、W2R、S2、S2R、双臂 CCS）仍需开通 `fa-deploy-ws`。W1/W2/S2 URDF 与"
"Gen1/Gen2 USD 远端已公开；**W2R 与 S2R 尚未开放**。见"
"[FiveAges 机器人描述](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)"
"。工作区权限与硬件分配请联系组长。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:204
#: c4831dc2c16641ac998cf6c9d6b7ad1f
msgid ""
"Clone `fa-deploy-ws` and run the init / quick-start scripts named in "
"**that repository’s README** (not public). Flags and robot IDs are "
"documented only there."
msgstr ""
"克隆 `fa-deploy-ws`，并运行**该仓库 README**（非公开）中写明的 init / quick-start 脚本。参数和机器人"
" ID 只写在那里。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:205
#: 56e761773d204d3592b4602b3b939d6d
msgid "Follow [fa-deploy-ws Setup](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr "见 [fa-deploy-ws 配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:207
#: 0da5168d1b664b0a9395ece7a6cec0b8
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Verify in `mock_components` (or that workspace’s documented "
"sim path) before `hardware:=real`."
msgstr "**安全：** 先在 `mock_components`（或该工作区文档中的仿真路径）验证，再使用 `hardware:=real`。"

