msgstr "可选：合成数据（Isaac）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:223
#: 199f742892f346669761b266714ad54b
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Understand the Isaac datagen path (not Gazebo): USD scene → "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` → composer `task_queue` → LeRobot dataset on disk."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 弄清 Isaac 数据采集路径（不是 Gazebo）：USD 场景 → `ROS2RobotInterface` → "
"composer `task_queue` → 磁盘上的 LeRobot 数据集。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:225
#: ac681ee67524401186a5822cd1424ac6
msgid ""
"Follow [Synthetic Data](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md). "
"Documented composer/lerobot branches are `feature/dex-grasp-generator` "
"and `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`. Stop at recording/export; skip training."
msgstr ""
"见 [合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)。文档对应的 composer/lerobot "
"分支是 `feature/dex-grasp-generator` 与 `feature/sim-grasp-"
"datagen`。停在录制/导出；跳过训练。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:227
#: 7e4d498558f24283aa2eb8a6d368f61a
msgid "After the beginner path"
msgstr "新手路径之后"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: d5c573b1ef93491a9eb9cd1c29682355
msgid ""
"Continue by **role** in [More "
"applications](../6-more_applications/0-index.md): field commissioning "
"(现场调试), classical algorithm (传统方案算法工程师), VLA collect / train / deploy "
"(VLA 采训推), simulation (仿真工程师)."
msgstr ""
"按 **角色** 继续看[更多应用](../6-more_applications/0-index.md)：现场调试、传统方案算法工程师、VLA "
"采训推、仿真工程师。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: 1840c71ee8ba4ef78027e9a7269a6d51
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "实用建议"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:233
#: 92d8f578cc0b4b5daaf6c9a5a6c97168
msgid ""
"**Don't skip mock mode** — Always verify behavior in mock before "
"simulation or real hardware"
msgstr "**不要跳过 mock 模式** — 在进入仿真或真实硬件之前，务必先在 mock 中验证行为"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:234
#: 3833dad3cbef47c493c3cf9f8b4864a6
msgid ""
"**Read the warnings** — The stack logs helpful messages about "
"configuration issues"
msgstr "**阅读警告信息** — 技术栈会记录有助于排查配置问题的日志"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:235
#: 234c5ce0ba444dd6b8af66988499e90b
msgid ""
"**Use lean branches** — `open-deploy-ws` offers `dobot-cr5`, `arx-"
"lift2s`, and `panthera-ht`"
msgstr "**使用精简分支** — `open-deploy-ws` 提供 `dobot-cr5`、`arx-lift2s` 和 `panthera-ht`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:236
#: d6a4b3b6e5224fb2bf1af24e45e07190
